<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="creating-robot-account-api">
  <title>Creating a robot account by using the Red Hat Quay API</title>
  <shortdesc>To automate access to your repositories, you can create a robot account by using the Red Hat Quay API. You can create robot accounts for an organization or for your own user account.</shortdesc>
  <taskbody>
    <prereq>
      <ul>
        <li>You have created an OAuth access token.</li>
      </ul>
    </prereq>
    <steps-unordered>
      <step>
        <cmd>Enter the following command to create a new robot account for an organization by using the <codeph>PUT /api/v1/organization/{orgname}/robots/{robot_shortname}</codeph> endpoint:
</cmd>
        <info>
          <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">$ curl -X PUT   -H "Authorization: Bearer &lt;bearer_token&gt;" "https://&lt;quay-server.example.com&gt;/api/v1/organization/&lt;organization_name&gt;/robots/&lt;robot_name&gt;"</codeblock>
          <p outputclass="title">
            <b>Example output</b>
          </p>
          <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">{"name": "orgname+robot-name", "created": "Fri, 10 May 2024 15:11:00 -0000", "last_accessed": null, "description": "", "token": "&lt;example_secret&gt;", "unstructured_metadata": null}</codeblock>
        </info>
      </step>
      <step>
        <cmd>Enter the following command to create a new robot account for the current user with the <codeph>PUT /api/v1/user/robots/{robot_shortname}</codeph> endpoint:
</cmd>
        <info>
          <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">$ curl -X PUT   -H "Authorization: Bearer &lt;bearer_token&gt;" "https://&lt;quay-server.example.com&gt;/api/v1/user/robots/&lt;robot_name&gt;"</codeblock>
          <p outputclass="title">
            <b>Example output</b>
          </p>
          <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">{"name": "quayadmin+robot-name", "created": "Fri, 10 May 2024 15:24:57 -0000", "last_accessed": null, "description": "", "token": "&lt;example_secret&gt;", "unstructured_metadata": null}</codeblock>
        </info>
      </step>
    </steps-unordered>
  </taskbody>
</task>
